(Scaled Dot-Product Attention: We compute the attention function) Tj
T* (on a set of queries simultaneously, packed together into a matrix) Tj
T* (Q. The keys and values are also packed into matrices K and V. We) Tj
T* (compute the matrix of outputs as softmax\(QK^T / sqrt\(d_k\)\)V.) Tj
